# Firmware binaries - built fresh by every build path (build_exe.bat, build_linux.sh/.ps1,
# release-firmware.yml) from src/ via PlatformIO, never hand-maintained. Not committed so there's
# a single source of truth (the C++ source + release_version.json), not two.
